## Task 4.4 – Prevent Recurrence (1 Mark)

1. A base class with virtual functions should have a virtual destructor when objects may be deleted through base-class pointers.
2. Use the `override` keyword in derived classes to ensure that the function correctly overrides a base-class virtual function.

